                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is realistic Meta CPL for skincare in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 60-220 for clean beauty + K-beauty + men's grooming. Rs 120-280 for ayurveda. Rs 180-400 for clinical. Rs 350-900 for luxury. Varies by sub-vertical + AOV + concern + season.</p>
                                        <h3>What is realistic Google CPL for skincare in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 180-450 for clean beauty + K-beauty. Rs 200-500 for ayurveda. Rs 300-800 for clinical. Rs 600-1,500 for luxury. Higher than Meta due to keyword competition, offset by higher intent.</p>
                                        <h3>What is realistic CPL for skincare in Dubai + UAE?</h3>
                                        <p>AED 6-22 Meta trilingual (Rs 130-500). AED 10-40 Google (Rs 220-900). AED 4-15 Snapchat (Rs 90-330). Higher AOV enables higher CPL breakeven. ROAS 2.5-5x paid + 4-8x organic-attributed.</p>
                                        <h3>What is realistic CPL for skincare in Saudi Arabia?</h3>
                                        <p>SAR 3-14 Snapchat (Rs 65-310, DOMINANT channel). SAR 5-20 Meta (Rs 110-440). SAR 8-35 Google (Rs 180-780). SAR 4-16 TikTok. ROAS 3-6x paid + 5-10x organic due to Vision 2030 + heritage-gifting peaks.</p>
                                        <h3>What concern has lowest CPL in skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Dryness + hydration + dullness (Rs 80-220 Meta) due to broad relevance + high search volume. Anti-aging + sensitive + rosacea highest (Rs 200-500+) due to competition + niche.</p>
                                        <h3>What CPL optimisation levers work in skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Concern-specific creative (25-40% reduction) + ingredient messaging (20-35%) + derm + creator UGC (30-50%) + skin quiz landing (2-3x lead quality) + WhatsApp opt-in (40-60% higher conversion) + regional-language (25-40%) + retargeting UGC (40-70%).</p>
                                        <h3>Should we optimise for CPL or ROAS or LTV?</h3>
                                        <p>LTV / CAC + payback. CPL alone misleading (lower CPL sometimes = lower-intent lead + lower conversion). ROAS single-purchase snapshot. LTV / CAC + 6-12 month payback = true economics. Optimise attribution to LTV / CAC first.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD approach CPL benchmarking?</h3>
                                        <p>Real live-campaign benchmarks across 20+ skincare brands + India + GCC. Custom benchmarking by brand + sub-vertical + geography during onboarding. Ad spend transparent pass-through + platform receipts + LTV/CAC/cohort reporting. Book Calendly on <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
